{
  "scene_id": "072_flow_between_moments",
  "description": "Chapter 13: The Flow Between Moments",
  "entities": [],
  "locations": [
    {
      "id": "unknown",
      "name": "Unknown",
      "description": "Location: Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "path": "Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "type": "area"
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 10,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"It's maddening,\"",
        "line": 17
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 14,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I don't understand how to control it,\"",
        "line": 23
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 20,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Fragmentation,\"",
        "line": 31
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 25,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Draco essence rebels against limitation,\"",
        "line": 38
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 31,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Which is why,\"",
        "line": 46
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 37,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Young Master of Chaos,\"",
        "line": 55
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 42,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Control is the illusion, young guardian. Flow is the truth. Watch.\"",
        "line": 63
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 51,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I don't know how!\"",
        "line": 78
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 53,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Time is not a river,\"",
        "line": 81
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 57,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Stop fighting,\"",
        "line": 87
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 62,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then learn by letting go.\"",
        "line": 94
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 66,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Breathe with the current,\"",
        "line": 100
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 75,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"While I learn flow,\"",
        "line": 113
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 81,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Your friend learns foundation,\"",
        "line": 121
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 85,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Together, you will be unstoppable,\"",
        "line": 127
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 89,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Watch the portal,\"",
        "line": 133
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 96,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"But I didn't directly interfere, I just made a hopeful guess,\"",
        "line": 143
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 105,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You have a long way to go.. but the more rigid foundations you learned to should at least be able to show me the web around this moment,\"",
        "line": 156
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 109,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The man or family who saved her as a child,\"",
        "line": 162
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 112,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And forward?\"",
        "line": 167
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 115,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"If she succeeds... the earth itself becomes her ally. Not just magic, but a living partnership that connects her to every growing thing on the planet. She becomes not just a queen but a living bridge between consciousness and creation.\"",
        "line": 172
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 126,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Well read,\"",
        "line": 190
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 132,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Flow mastery is only part of the foundation,\"",
        "line": 199
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 137,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Move through the temporal maze,\"",
        "line": 206
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 152,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Temporal Web,\"",
        "line": 226
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 158,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Time is not linear,\"",
        "line": 234
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 160,
      "actor": "Nyssa",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Understanding dawns,\"",
        "line": 237
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 162,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Raw Draco essence without training is like trying to drink an ocean,\"",
        "line": 241
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 164,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The first trial is complete,\"",
        "line": 245
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 167,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You have learned the most fundamental truth of temporal guardianship: we do not control time\u2014we serve it. We help it flow toward outcomes that preserve growth, possibility, and hope.\"",
        "line": 250
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 169,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The student was ready to learn,\"",
        "line": 254
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 174,
      "actor": "Nyssa",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"How do you feel?\"",
        "line": 261
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 175,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201c\u2018Less fractured,\u2019 Vi\u00ean replied\u2026 \u2018for the moment, the noise has quieted.\u2019\u201d",
        "line": 263
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 178,
      "actor": "Nyssa",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Foundation,\"",
        "line": 268
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 183,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201c\u2018The first stabilization,\u2019 Voss observed cautiously. \"",
        "line": 275
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 185,
      "actor": "Zephyr",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Next, you learn foundation,\"",
        "line": 278
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 188,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Temporal Foundation Grid,\"",
        "line": 283
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 193,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"She grows stronger with each trial,\"",
        "line": 290
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 198,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Foundation,\"",
        "line": 297
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 204,
      "actor": "Nyssa",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Understanding dawns,\"",
        "line": 305
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 208,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"But that's tomorrow's lesson,\"",
        "line": 311
      }
    }
  ],
